#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:6
msgid "Per-act billing"
msgstr "Facturation à l'acte"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:9
msgid ""
"Billing per act in a WideCare general practice: the acts of a consultation, "
"the fee and the patient share, third-party payment, and the invoice of each "
"patient."
msgstr ""
"La facturation à l'acte dans un cabinet de médecine générale WideCare : les "
"actes d'une consultation, l'honoraire et la part du patient, le tiers payant"
" et la facture de chaque patient."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:13
msgid "What does the patient's invoice carry?"
msgstr "Que porte la facture du patient ?"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:14
msgid ""
"The whole fee of each act, or only the patient share when the act is in "
"third-party payment: the insurer's share is then claimed from the insurer."
msgstr ""
"L'honoraire complet de chaque acte, ou seulement la part du patient quand "
"l'acte est en tiers payant : la part de l'assureur est alors réclamée à "
"l'assureur."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:16
msgid "Can I change an invoiced act?"
msgstr "Puis-je modifier un acte facturé ?"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:17
msgid ""
"No. Cancel its invoice first: the act goes back to **To Invoice**, ready to "
"correct and invoice again."
msgstr ""
"Non. Annulez d'abord sa facture : l'acte revient à **À facturer**, prêt à "
"être corrigé et refacturé."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:19
msgid "Can I invoice several acts at once?"
msgstr "Puis-je facturer plusieurs actes à la fois ?"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:20
msgid ""
"Yes. In **Practice → Billable Acts**, select the acts and use **Create "
"Invoices** in the **Actions** menu: one invoice per patient."
msgstr ""
"Oui. Dans **Cabinet → Actes facturables**, sélectionnez les actes et "
"utilisez **Créer les factures** dans le menu **Actions** : une facture par "
"patient."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:22
msgid "Is VAT applied to the acts?"
msgstr "La TVA s'applique-t-elle aux actes ?"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:23
msgid ""
"No. Each line is booked on the **Healthcare Act** product, a service without"
" tax. Your accountant sets its income account."
msgstr ""
"Non. Chaque ligne est comptabilisée sur le produit **Acte de soins**, un "
"service sans taxe. Votre comptable en fixe le compte de produits."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:26
msgid ""
"A **billable act** is one act performed for one patient on one day: its "
"code, its fee and who pays what. The acts of a consultation become the "
"patient's invoice."
msgstr ""
"Un **acte facturable** est un acte réalisé pour un patient un jour donné : "
"son code, son honoraire et qui paie quoi. Les actes d'une consultation "
"deviennent la facture du patient."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:30
msgid "Who pays what"
msgstr "Qui paie quoi"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:32
msgid "Each act carries:"
msgstr "Chaque acte porte :"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:34
msgid "**Code** and **Description**: the act in your country's nomenclature;"
msgstr ""
"**Code** et **Description** : l'acte dans la nomenclature de votre pays ;"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:35
msgid "**Quantity** and **Unit Fee**;"
msgstr "**Quantité** et **Honoraire unitaire** ;"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:36
msgid "**Fee**: quantity × unit fee;"
msgstr "**Honoraire** : quantité × honoraire unitaire ;"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:37
msgid "**Patient Share**: what the patient owes under the insurance rules;"
msgstr ""
"**Part patient** : ce que le patient doit selon les règles de l'assurance ;"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:38
msgid "**Insurer Share**: the fee minus the patient share;"
msgstr "**Part mutuelle** : l'honoraire moins la part du patient ;"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:39
msgid ""
"**Third-Party Payment**: ticked when the insurer is billed directly for its "
"share."
msgstr ""
"**Tiers payant** : coché quand l'assureur est facturé directement pour sa "
"part."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:42
msgid ""
"Without third-party payment, the patient's invoice carries the **whole "
"fee**. With it, the invoice carries the **patient share** only."
msgstr ""
"Sans tiers payant, la facture du patient porte l'**honoraire complet**. Avec"
" le tiers payant, elle ne porte que la **part du patient**."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:45
msgid ""
"The patient share lies between zero and the fee, and the quantity is always "
"positive."
msgstr ""
"La part du patient est comprise entre zéro et l'honoraire, et la quantité "
"est toujours positive."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:48
msgid "Bill a consultation"
msgstr "Facturer une consultation"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:50
msgid "Open the consultation and go to the **Acts** tab."
msgstr "Ouvrez la consultation et allez dans l'onglet **Actes**."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:51
msgid ""
"Add a line per act: **Code**, **Description**, **Quantity**, **Unit Fee**, "
"**Patient Share**, and tick **Third-Party Payment** when it applies."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez une ligne par acte : **Code**, **Description**, **Quantité**, "
"**Honoraire unitaire**, **Part patient**, et cochez **Tiers payant** s'il "
"s'applique."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:53
msgid ""
"Check the **Total Fee** and the **Total Patient Share** under the lines."
msgstr ""
"Vérifiez le **Total des honoraires** et le **Total part patient** sous les "
"lignes."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:54
msgid "Click **Create Invoice**."
msgstr "Cliquez sur **Créer la facture**."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:56
msgid ""
"WideCare prices the acts not priced yet, then creates the invoice. The "
"**Invoices** button of the consultation opens it."
msgstr ""
"WideCare tarife les actes qui ne le sont pas encore, puis crée la facture. "
"Le bouton **Factures** de la consultation l'ouvre."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:61
msgid "The billable acts"
msgstr "Les actes facturables"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:63
msgid ""
"**Practice → Billable Acts** lists every act, open on those **To Invoice**. "
"The same list sits in **Invoicing → Customers → Billable Acts**, next to the"
" customer invoices."
msgstr ""
"**Cabinet → Actes facturables** liste tous les actes, ouverte sur ceux **À "
"facturer**. La même liste se trouve dans **Facturation → Clients → Actes "
"facturables**, à côté des factures clients."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:12
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Statut"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:12
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Ce que ça veut dire"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:12
msgid "**Draft**"
msgstr "**Brouillon**"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:12
msgid "Recorded, not priced yet."
msgstr "Enregistré, pas encore tarifé."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:12
msgid "**To Invoice**"
msgstr "**À facturer**"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:12
msgid "Priced, waiting for its invoice."
msgstr "Tarifé, en attente de sa facture."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:12
msgid "**Invoiced**"
msgstr "**Facturé**"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:12
msgid "On an invoice: locked."
msgstr "Sur une facture : verrouillé."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:12
msgid "**Cancelled**"
msgstr "**Annulé**"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:12
msgid "Will not be billed."
msgstr "Ne sera pas facturé."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:74
msgid "On an act:"
msgstr "Sur un acte :"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:76
msgid ""
"**Price** prices the act and moves it to **To Invoice**: the amounts you "
"typed stay, unless your country's tariff gives them;"
msgstr ""
"**Tarifer** tarife l'acte et le fait passer à **À facturer** : les montants "
"que vous avez tapés restent, sauf si le tarif de votre pays les donne ;"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:78
msgid "**Create Invoice** invoices it;"
msgstr "**Créer la facture** le facture ;"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:79
msgid "**Reset to Draft** brings back a cancelled act or one to invoice;"
msgstr "**Remettre en brouillon** ramène un acte annulé ou à facturer ;"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:80
msgid "**Cancel** withdraws an act that is not invoiced."
msgstr "**Annuler** retire un acte qui n'est pas facturé."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:82
msgid ""
"To invoice a batch, select the acts in the list, then **Actions → Create "
"Invoices**: one invoice per patient."
msgstr ""
"Pour facturer un lot, sélectionnez les actes dans la liste, puis **Actions →"
" Créer les factures** : une facture par patient."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:85
msgid "The invoice"
msgstr "La facture"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:87
msgid ""
"The invoice is an ordinary customer invoice of the **Invoicing** app: one "
"line per act, without tax. Its **Acts** button opens the acts it carries."
msgstr ""
"La facture est une facture client ordinaire de l'application **Facturation**"
" : une ligne par acte, sans taxe. Son bouton **Actes** ouvre les actes "
"qu'elle porte."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:90
msgid ""
"When an invoice is cancelled or deleted, its acts go back to **To Invoice**."
" An invoiced act can be neither changed nor deleted."
msgstr ""
"Quand une facture est annulée ou supprimée, ses actes reviennent à **À "
"facturer**. Un acte facturé ne peut être ni modifié ni supprimé."

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:93
msgid "In Belgium"
msgstr "En Belgique"

#: ../../content/medecins/facturation-a-l-acte.md:96
msgid ""
"The INAMI nomenclature prices the act — the fee and the personal share, "
"ordinary or BIM — and the acts in third-party payment are claimed from the "
"mutualities with the eFact per act: see [The INAMI "
"nomenclature](../belgique/medecins/nomenclature.md) and [eFact per "
"act](../belgique/medecins/efact-a-l-acte.md)."
msgstr ""
"La nomenclature INAMI tarife l'acte — l'honoraire et le ticket modérateur, "
"ordinaire ou BIM — et les actes en tiers payant sont réclamés aux mutualités"
" par l'eFact à l'acte : voir [La nomenclature "
"INAMI](../belgique/medecins/nomenclature.md) et [eFact à "
"l'acte](../belgique/medecins/efact-a-l-acte.md)."

